msgctxt "84_Hyped-up Henchman"
msgid "The top members of our family have been on edge lately...\\r\nI get the feeling an all-out war's about to go down."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "96_Troubled Thug"
msgid "Yeah, same here. My people told me to stay in\\r\nconstant contact in case the shit hits the fan."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "108_Hyped-up Henchman"
msgid "Things are really heating up around the Ueno Seiwa Clan.\\r\nThey're running around like crazy trying to find some guy."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "120_Troubled Thug"
msgid "Hey, that reminds me. I was told to call in\\r\nif I come across some guy named Mishima."
msgstr ""

